AnyRoyale
Third-party components and assets included in this repository:

1. crforge battle engine (server/engine/crforge-core, server/engine/crforge-data)
   Copyright 2025-2026 voonhous — Apache License 2.0 (server/engine/LICENSE, server/engine/NOTICE).
   Vendored from https://github.com/voonhous/crforge at b41cf9b6276945152ec4c869ce56f98a5fa3f513
   and modified by AnyRoyale; every change is listed in server/engine/VENDOR.md.

2. 3D models (apps/web/public/assets/models)
   Derived from KayKit asset packs by Kay Lousberg (www.kaylousberg.com), CC0 1.0.
   Sources and pinned commits: tools/asset-pipeline/sources.json, per-file origins in
   apps/web/public/assets/models/index.json. The forged_*.glb unit models are assembled from those
   CC0 parts by tools/character-forge (recipes in tools/character-forge/recipes.py).

3. Sound effects and music (apps/web/public/assets/sfx)
   Derived from CC0 1.0 sound packs by Kenney (kenney.nl) and by "rubberduck" on OpenGameArt.org,
   and CC0 1.0 music by "cynicmusic" on OpenGameArt.org.
   Sources and pinned SHA-256 hashes: tools/audio-pipeline/sources.json, per-sound mapping in
   tools/audio-pipeline/sounds.json and apps/web/public/assets/sfx/index.json.

4. npm / Maven dependencies (three.js, Vite, Javalin, Jackson, ...) are fetched at build time
   under their own licences and are not stored in this repository.

